[2026-09-14 07:29:25] REQ 260914071019-232 START backend=Ollama model=glm-5.3-flash:cloud msgs=464 roles=assistant,tool,assistant,tool,assistant,tool tail=[{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_bku1mfgs","function":{"index":0,"name":"write_subtask","arguments":{"content":"#+TITLE: Fix 2: delegate timeout vs live pipeline (c308)\n\ncontinuo 09-14 cycle died exit 255. iar--delegate-timeout-handler\n(delegate.el) fired at 600s while the pipeline buffer still had live\nsub-agent requests (the cascade ran 12+ min). The handler:\n- marked completed-sym (c149 fix, correct),\n- gptel-abort'ed the pipeline buffer's LIVE curl request,\n- armed a 3s kill-buffer timer,\n- called the parent callback.\nThe orphaned sub-agents kept running; their completion hooks,\nre-prompt timers (1s), and buffer-kill timers (3s/5s) raced the\nabort/kill path. One timer (07:09:24Z) + one curl sentinel\n(07:10:04Z) hit dead/nil buffers -> wrong-type-argument stringp nil\n-> exit 255.\n\nFIX SHAPE (design needed):\n- Before aborting, check the delegate buffer for live sub-requests\n  (gptel--request-alist entries with :buffer = the delegate buffer,\n  or delegate child buffers still alive).\n- If live: either (a) extend the timeout once with a warning, or\n  (b) drain: wait for sub-requests to finish, then complete with the\n  partial result. Never abort a request that is actively streaming.\n- The 3s kill-buffer timer must not fire while any child delegate\n  buffer is alive.\n\nEvidence: knowledge/aria/continuo-delegate-cascade-crash-2026-09-14.md\n(c149 precedent: aria c148 died the same way 2026-09-10).","path":"iar/delegate-cascade-fixes/fix-2-timeout-vs-live-pipeline"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[07:29:15] Subtask written: iar/delegate-cascade-fixes/fix-2-timeout-vs-live-pipeline\n[t+18:56/60:00 c229/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_uftmjqmj","function":{"index":0,"name":"write_subtask","arguments":{"content":"#+TITLE: Fix 3: REQUESTS.log attribution race (c308)\n\niar--reqlog-agent (iar-request-log.el) is a process-global captured\nat each START advice and used by later RESPONSE/PARSE events. With\nconcurrent sub-agents (delegation), every START overwrites the\nglobal; RESPONSE/PARSE events land in whichever agent's log was\nwritten most recently.\n\nVERIFIED LIVE (2026-09-14, continuo run 260914065006):\n- continuo's -172 RESPONSE+PARSE sits in agent-assistant/REQUESTS.log\n  (spec delegate reviewer) while its START is in continuo's log.\n- implementer's -167 sits in reviewer/REQUESTS.log.\nConsequence: per-agent request censuses that trust log boundaries\nare wrong during any delegated run. Census law addition: during\ndelegation windows, dedupe by REQ id across ALL agent logs.\n\nFIX: attribute per-fsm, not per-global. iar--reqlog-processes\nalready maps process -> REQ id; extend it (or a parallel hash) to\nalso carry the agent name captured at START, and have the\nRESPONSE/PARSE advice resolve the agent from that hash instead of\nthe global. Test: simulate two interleaved requests with different\nbuffers, assert each event lands in the right log.","path":"iar/delegate-cascade-fixes/fix-3-reqlog-attribution-race"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[07:29:20] Subtask written: iar/delegate-cascade-fixes/fix-3-reqlog-attribution-race\n[t+19:02/60:00 c230/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_869crbya","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/personalization && ls tasks/iar/ | head -5; echo ---; ls tasks/iar/delegate-cascade-fixes/ 2>/dev/null; echo ---; echo \"=== git add -f the new task files (tasks/ gitignored but tracked) ===\"; git add -f tasks/iar/delegate-cascade-fixes/ 2>&1 | head -2; git status --short | head -8"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[07:29:25] ROADMAP.org\nagora\nagora-v2-relay\naria\nconnectome-snapshot\n---\n---\n=== git add -f the new task files (tasks/ gitignored but tracked) ===\nwarning: could not open directory 'tasks/iar/delegate-cascade-fixes/': No such file or directory\nfatal: pathspec 'tasks/iar/delegate-cascade-fixes/' did no...[+327 chars]
