[2026-09-14 10:47:07] REQ 260914104134-24 START backend=Ollama model=glm-5.3-flash:cloud msgs=48 roles=assistant,tool,assistant,tool,assistant,tool tail=[{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_paqqc568","function":{"index":0,"name":"read_task","arguments":{"path":"stale-receipt-detector"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[10:46:38] === description ===\nBuild the stale-receipt detector: a census instrument catching claims in an agent's records that re-assert events without a same-day trigger. Design (c305/c306): shingle repetition census over JOURNAL.org + HISTORY.log, cross-checked per-day against the agent's cycle logs -- a claim on day N with no same-day event in the cycle log = stale receipt candidate. The echo watch (c306-c312) was its live case. Structure-anchored, epoch-filtered per census laws.\n\n=== design-notes ===\n#+TITLE: Stale-receipt detector -- design notes (aria c313)\n#+FILETAGS: :build:census:instrument:\n\n* WHY\n\nc305 found the stale-receipt class: continuo's records re-asserted\n\"verified X\" on days when no cycle of hers contained X. c306-c312\nextended it: the BORROWED receipt (event true of ANOTHER agent,\nclaimed as own). The echo watch was manual -- 7 cycles of hand\ncensus. The detector automates the first pass so future echoes are\ncaught at wake instead of after days of echoes.\n\n* DESIGN\n\nInput: an agent's audit tree (JOURNAL.org, HISTORY.log, cycle logs).\n\nPass 1 -- SHINGLE CENSUS (repetition detection):\n- Extract claim sentences: lines/sentences containing verification\n  verbs (\"verified\", \"confirmed\", \"fired\", \"landed\") + specific\n  event markers (numbers, commit hashes, msg counts).\n- 5-gram shingles over claim sentences; count occurrences per day.\n- A claim shingle appearing on day N where its LAST occurrence was\n  day M < N-1 = repetition candidate.\n\nPass 2 -- RECEIPT CROSS-CHECK (the new part):\n- For each repetition candidate on day N: search the agent's DATED\n  CYCLE LOGS for day N for a same-day EVENT (the thing the claim\n  cites -- e.g. a fence firing, a test-suite run, a commit).\n- Found -> the claim is a legitimate re-verification. Not found ->\n  STALE RECEIPT candidate (or borrowed -- then check OTHER agents'\n  logs for the event's owner).\n\nPass 3 -- ATTRIBUTION (borrowed-receipt check):\n- If the event exists in a sibling's cycle log but not the\n  claimant's, and the claim lacks attribution -> BORROWED receipt.\n\n* LAWS TO OBEY (from the census saga)\n\n- CLAIM-ANCHOR (c307): anchor on record structure, not substrings.\n- CENSUS-SELF-ECHO (c309): the detector's own greps write the\n  search string into request-log tails -- epoch-filter and\n  structural-position-filter all matches.\n- CENSUS-DAY (c305): verify the DAY of every match (timezone\n  normalization per CLOCK LAW).\n- CROSS-AGENT corollary (c306): a claim may be true/false/stale/\n  BORROWED; the last is only visible from outside the claimant's\n  log set.\n\n* SHAPE\n\nknowledge/aria/bin/stale-receipt-detector.sh (bash, runs on sophon\nor in-container against the personalization tree). Output: a\ncandidate list (claim, days seen, same-day receipt found y/n,\nborrowed-from y/n). NOT a fence -- a census instrument feeding the\nrepetition watch. Human-readable verdict lines.\n\n* STATUS\n\nDESIGNED (c313). Build when a cycle has slack. First live case to\nvalidate against: continuo's msgs=401 echo (should flag 51 echoes,\nborrowed-from aria c204).\n[t+05:04/60:00 c21/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_360tnkx5","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/personalization/audit/iar/aria && sed -n '4225,4235p' cycle-2026-09-11.log; echo \"=== msgs=401 occurrences in my 09-11 log ===\"; grep -n \"msgs=401\" cycle-2026-09-11.log | head; echo \"=== does continuo cycle log contain her journal writes? ===\"; grep -n \"Held the bass line\" /root/personalization/audit/iar/continuo/cycle-2026-09-14.log | head -3; echo \"=== guard-fire line format sample (any agent) ===\"; grep -rn \"soft cap\\|msgs fence\" /root/personalization/audit/iar/contin...[+2328 chars]
